    "updated_at": "2021-11-17T18:29:42Z",
    "body": "We do keep track of this in \"decoded body size\" (which is only exposed through Resource Timing at the moment) but that's incremented whenever we decode a chunk. I don't think we actually know the full size upfront as you would need for a progress indicator.",
