    "created_at": "2022-08-29T09:36:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-08-29T09:36:17Z",
    "body": "> With Content-Encoding: gzip it might be possible after receiving the gzip header, but it is not possible with Content-Encoding: deflate.\r\n\r\nSadly the gzip header doesn't contain size information. The gzip footer does, but that's not useful for calculating progress.",
