    "created_at": "2022-09-04T20:13:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-09-04T20:13:16Z",
    "body": "Putting the information on ReadableStream means it's not possible to use the convenience methods (e.g. `json()`, `arrayBuffer()`, `blob()`), as the body is locked to one reader. I'm not sure where the progress information should go, but ideally it would go somewhere that would work together with those convenience methods.",
